Z||000005||mrfixit58||02-13-2001||08:21 AM||||Hey, I had one of them! it was an 84 and road like a 1 ton flatbed truck. I sold my first Fiero after I bought the 'Vette and about a month later, I was wishing I had my Fiero back. I only drove the Vette for about a year and sold it. That one looks more like a 85-87. It should ride better than the 84. Keep your Fiero until your SURE the 'Vette's the right car for you.<P>Roy  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||6
